{"4228240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grandma's Coloring Book", "steam_appid": 4228240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I got a voicemail from my grandma today - two days after my mom died. She asked me to come see her new book at her mansion.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The thing is, she's never spoken a single word to anyone before now.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What's so important about this book?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228240/extras/765e4ede036a58c9c2dc90b475cda95b.poster.avif?t=1786799561\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228240/extras/765e4ede036a58c9c2dc90b475cda95b.webm?t=1786799561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228240/extras/765e4ede036a58c9c2dc90b475cda95b.mp4?t=1786799561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRANDMA'S COLORING BOOK</strong> is a psychological horror journey through the dark, tangled history of the Hooklock family using sewing needles and steam. Traverse a vast, unusual estate where even the furniture can't be trusted, and unknowable whispers slither down your spine. Will you find Grandma Hooklock, or will something darker be smiling from the shadows instead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Jessica as she takes on a generational evil with her family's tools. <strong>GRANDMA'S COLORING BOOK</strong> includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tense, ever-changing rooms and dark corners to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Horror that stems from somewhere unholy and familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A massive mansion full of secrets to unt